{"slug": "C_S02E16", "video_name": "Community - S02E16 - Intermediate Documentary Filmmaking Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E16 - Intermediate Documentary Filmmaking Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1266.949, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 494, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.0, "text": "It's HAWT."}, {"start": 2.0, "end": 4.0, "text": "Guys, what happened?"}, {"start": 4.0, "end": 7.0, "text": "Apparently, they found him unconscious on a park bench."}, {"start": 7.0, "end": 8.0, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 8.0, "end": 9.0, "text": "Is he okay?"}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 9.903225806451612, "text": "We don't know."}, {"start": 9.903225806451612, "end": 11.0, "text": "We just got here."}, {"start": 11.0, "end": 13.048780487804878, "text": "He's ready for visitors now."}, {"start": 13.048780487804878, "end": 14.0, "text": "He's in 1023."}, {"start": 17.0, "end": 18.0, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 18.0, "end": 21.0, "text": "Oh, welcome, my old friends."}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 22.0, "text": "Welcome."}, {"start": 22.0, "end": 23.536585365853657, "text": "Here's what happened."}, {"start": 23.536585365853657, "end": 25.0, "text": "We were all so high."}, {"start": 25.0, "end": 25.85, "text": "It was the pills."}, {"start": 25.85, "end": 27.0, "text": "They just took me over."}, {"start": 27.0, "end": 30.0, "text": "I saw awful, horrible things."}, {"start": 30.0, "end": 35.0, "text": "Demons, aliens, critters, something called Bruce Willis surrogates."}, {"start": 37.0, "end": 39.0, "text": "Hobbit, what are you guys doing?"}, {"start": 39.0, "end": 39.74074074074074, "text": "It's okay."}, {"start": 39.74074074074074, "end": 41.0, "text": "Just act natural."}, {"start": 41.0, "end": 44.0, "text": "Pierce asked me to document his life for historical purposes."}, {"start": 44.0, "end": 47.0, "text": "At first I said no, because at the risk of sounding overly sensitive,"}, {"start": 47.0, "end": 49.0, "text": "I feel intensely bored by Pierce as a subject."}, {"start": 49.0, "end": 52.0, "text": "But I'm excited about the narrative facility of the documentary format."}, {"start": 52.0, "end": 55.0, "text": "It's easier to tell a complex story when you can just cut to people"}, {"start": 55.0, "end": 56.0, "text": "explaining things to the camera."}, {"start": 56.0, "end": 59.0, "text": "I've called everyone here so that I could put my house in order,"}, {"start": 59.0, "end": 62.0, "text": "bequeath, party, and gifts."}, {"start": 62.0, "end": 65.0, "text": "Say my final words to each of you."}, {"start": 65.0, "end": 65.72727272727273, "text": "Final words?"}, {"start": 65.72727272727273, "end": 67.0, "text": "You're gonna kill us?"}, {"start": 67.0, "end": 67.9375, "text": "No, dummy."}, {"start": 67.9375, "end": 70.0, "text": "The pills wipe me out."}, {"start": 71.0, "end": 72.0, "text": "I'm dying."}, {"start": 73.0, "end": 74.0, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 74.0, "end": 76.0, "text": "I'm not really dying."}, {"start": 76.0, "end": 78.61627906976744, "text": "Over the last few weeks, it's become apparent"}, {"start": 78.61627906976744, "end": 81.0, "text": "how little respect this group has for me."}, {"start": 82.0, "end": 86.0, "text": "So I summon them here to exact my revenge."}, {"start": 86.0, "end": 87.0, "text": "See?"}, {"start": 87.0, "end": 88.0, "text": "Fishing a barrel."}, {"start": 112.0, "end": 113.88571428571429, "text": "I'm so sad."}, {"start": 113.88571428571429, "end": 118.0, "text": "I don't know what to do."}, {"start": 118.0, "end": 120.0, "text": "Usually if I need to cheer up, I just make fun of Pierce."}, {"start": 120.0, "end": 123.0, "text": "But now, it just makes me sadder."}, {"start": 123.0, "end": 125.0, "text": "It's Gregory Hines all over again."}, {"start": 125.0, "end": 126.38095238095238, "text": "Look, I'm sure he'll be fine."}, {"start": 126.38095238095238, "end": 128.0, "text": "You know how dramatic Pierce gets."}, {"start": 128.0, "end": 130.0, "text": "Remember when he had the hiccups and pulled the fire alarm?"}, {"start": 130.0, "end": 132.0, "text": "Let's just try to relax."}, {"start": 132.0, "end": 134.0, "text": "He's here because we relaxed."}, {"start": 134.0, "end": 135.59677419354838, "text": "No, he's here because he relaxed."}, {"start": 135.59677419354838, "end": 137.0, "text": "A handful of pills at a time."}, {"start": 137.0, "end": 138.67441860465115, "text": "And that's all over now."}, {"start": 138.67441860465115, "end": 140.0, "text": "We're here for him."}, {"start": 140.0, "end": 142.0, "text": "So there's no point in feeling bad."}, {"start": 142.0, "end": 143.5, "text": "Well, we know there's no point, Jeff."}, {"start": 143.5, "end": 145.0, "text": "We kind of just felt like feeling it."}, {"start": 145.0, "end": 147.0, "text": "Yeah, Jeff, what are you, I bad?"}, {"start": 147.0, "end": 147.7391304347826, "text": "Oh, sorry, I bad."}, {"start": 147.7391304347826, "end": 148.2173913043478, "text": "No problem."}, {"start": 148.2173913043478, "end": 149.0, "text": "Doesn't bother me."}, {"start": 149.0, "end": 149.1764705882353, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 149.1764705882353, "end": 152.0, "text": "Hawthorne is ready to commence his bequeathings."}, {"start": 153.0, "end": 155.0, "text": "Shouldn't you be telling that to an orderly?"}, {"start": 155.0, "end": 157.0, "text": "He's gonna give us gifts."}, {"start": 157.0, "end": 158.0, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 159.0, "end": 160.625, "text": "I mean, cool."}, {"start": 160.625, "end": 164.0, "text": "I don't want Pierce to die."}, {"start": 164.0, "end": 169.0, "text": "But if I'm gonna get bequeath'd upon, I like to be bequeath'd a drum kit."}, {"start": 169.0, "end": 171.0, "text": "Or a signed photo of Actula Barber."}, {"start": 171.0, "end": 173.0, "text": "Those would be my top two wishes."}, {"start": 173.0, "end": 176.0, "text": "My third wish would be a million wishes."}, {"start": 176.0, "end": 180.0, "text": "But I'd just use them all on a million signed photos of Actula Barber."}, {"start": 181.0, "end": 183.0, "text": "Hello, Pierce."}, {"start": 183.0, "end": 183.2, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 183.2, "end": 187.0, "text": "I got you some things from the gift shop to cheer you up."}, {"start": 187.0, "end": 191.0, "text": "I got you a John Grisham novel and a funny little coffee mug."}, {"start": 191.0, "end": 193.0, "text": "See how the fleas doormat says \"dog sweet.\""}, {"start": 193.0, "end": 197.0, "text": "Yeah, Shirley, we both know that you and I are the most hated in the group."}, {"start": 197.0, "end": 199.0, "text": "We do?"}, {"start": 199.0, "end": 201.54545454545453, "text": "And since in my absence, you'll be the new"}, {"start": 201.54545454545453, "end": 205.0, "text": "black sheep, or, I'm sorry, that's offensive, black swan."}, {"start": 205.0, "end": 206.51048951048952, "text": "I want you to have this."}, {"start": 206.51048951048952, "end": 210.2867132867133, "text": "It's a compact record, and it contains an audiophile of your"}, {"start": 210.2867132867133, "end": 214.0, "text": "study group talking about you while you're out of the room."}, {"start": 214.0, "end": 218.0, "text": "It's all here, and merch into this is skipped by optical lasers."}, {"start": 218.0, "end": 219.0, "text": "I don't believe you."}, {"start": 219.0, "end": 221.0, "text": "I know, it sounds like science fiction."}, {"start": 221.0, "end": 223.0, "text": "No, I don't believe there's anything on that."}, {"start": 223.0, "end": 227.0, "text": "Then I guess this is goodbye and forever."}, {"start": 227.0, "end": 230.0, "text": "Goodbye, Pierce."}, {"start": 232.0, "end": 234.0, "text": "It's about you later."}, {"start": 236.672, "end": 239.672, "text": "He said it's a recording of you all talking behind my back."}, {"start": 239.672, "end": 240.672, "text": "That's ridiculous."}, {"start": 240.672, "end": 244.672, "text": "That's what I told him, because you all don't do that, right?"}, {"start": 249.672, "end": 249.91524324324325, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 249.91524324324325, "end": 252.672, "text": "Hawthorne is requesting Sour Face."}, {"start": 256.672, "end": 257.672, "text": "Knock, knock."}, {"start": 257.672, "end": 258.672, "text": "Is that you, Death?"}, {"start": 258.672, "end": 259.672, "text": "It's Britta."}, {"start": 259.672, "end": 260.672, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 260.672, "end": 263.672, "text": "Before you speak, I just want to tell you that you don't have to give me anything."}, {"start": 263.672, "end": 265.672, "text": "I'm happy to just spend time with you."}, {"start": 265.672, "end": 267.672, "text": "You know what Dylan Thomas said about Death?"}, {"start": 267.672, "end": 268.672, "text": "No, tell me."}, {"start": 268.672, "end": 270.672, "text": "Okay, bluff called."}, {"start": 270.672, "end": 272.672, "text": "Britta, you're the selfless one in the group, right?"}, {"start": 272.672, "end": 274.672, "text": "When, no, I haven't thought about myself in years."}, {"start": 274.672, "end": 278.672, "text": "That's what makes you the perfect recipient of this bequeathed."}, {"start": 278.672, "end": 282.172, "text": "It's a check for $10,000 with the pay line blank so"}, {"start": 282.172, "end": 285.672, "text": "that you can give it to the charity of your choice."}, {"start": 285.672, "end": 286.672, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 286.672, "end": 291.672, "text": "Pierce, this is surprising."}, {"start": 291.672, "end": 294.672, "text": "After what you gave Shirley, we thought you were playing mind games."}, {"start": 294.672, "end": 296.672, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 299.71, "end": 302.71, "text": "Of course, if you're so inclined, you could always write your own name in there."}, {"start": 306.416, "end": 308.416, "text": "Toodles."}, {"start": 308.416, "end": 310.416, "text": "I don't want to die in a place like this."}, {"start": 310.416, "end": 312.416, "text": "People shouldn't die in the same places people magazines do."}, {"start": 312.416, "end": 314.416, "text": "I hope they die surrounded by my family."}, {"start": 314.416, "end": 316.416, "text": "That's the only way I agreed to be surrounded by my family."}, {"start": 316.416, "end": 318.416, "text": "Me and I have been having an agreement."}, {"start": 318.416, "end": 319.96702040816325, "text": "If one of us dies, we stage it to look"}, {"start": 319.96702040816325, "end": 322.416, "text": "like a suicide caused by the unjust cancellation of Firefly."}, {"start": 322.416, "end": 326.416, "text": "We're gonna get that show back on the air, buddy."}, {"start": 326.416, "end": 328.416, "text": "How'd it go?"}, {"start": 328.416, "end": 329.0081052631579, "text": "Oh, fine."}, {"start": 329.0081052631579, "end": 333.416, "text": "He gave me a check for $10,000 to give to the charity of my choice."}, {"start": 333.416, "end": 333.69670175438597, "text": "See?"}, {"start": 333.69670175438597, "end": 335.45108771929824, "text": "He's not messing with us."}, {"start": 335.45108771929824, "end": 337.416, "text": "Maybe he just hates Shirley."}, {"start": 337.416, "end": 338.416, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 338.416, "end": 340.416, "text": "Yeah, maybe."}, {"start": 340.416, "end": 344.416, "text": "You just need to research a few charities, because some take a lot off the top,"}, {"start": 344.416, "end": 346.416, "text": "and you think you're giving money to people that really need it,"}, {"start": 346.416, "end": 349.00220689655174, "text": "and you're really giving it to some middleman"}, {"start": 349.00220689655174, "end": 351.416, "text": "who's gonna pay off their parking tickets,"}, {"start": 351.416, "end": 357.416, "text": "credit cards, and keep from getting kicked out of her place in April."}, {"start": 357.416, "end": 359.416, "text": "He'd like to see Annie next?"}, {"start": 359.416, "end": 360.55113513513515, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 360.55113513513515, "end": 360.7943783783784, "text": "No."}, {"start": 360.7943783783784, "end": 362.416, "text": "He'll see Jeff next."}, {"start": 362.416, "end": 363.416, "text": "No, but you're not supposed to--"}, {"start": 363.416, "end": 363.77963636363637, "text": "Or what?"}, {"start": 363.77963636363637, "end": 366.416, "text": "You'll do twice as much work as a doctor for half the pay?"}, {"start": 366.416, "end": 368.416, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 368.416, "end": 370.416, "text": "It's all the complisalt, part compliment, part insult."}, {"start": 370.416, "end": 371.87314285714285, "text": "He invented them."}, {"start": 371.87314285714285, "end": 373.416, "text": "I coined the term."}, {"start": 373.416, "end": 375.416, "text": "See what I just said there?"}, {"start": 375.416, "end": 377.416, "text": "That was an explainer brag."}, {"start": 377.416, "end": 378.416, "text": "Hello, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 378.416, "end": 380.416, "text": "Pierce!"}, {"start": 383.416, "end": 387.416, "text": "I've thought about this day many times, but I've always imagined it differently."}, {"start": 387.416, "end": 391.416, "text": "For starters, I thought you'd be the one in bed, and I'd be a hologram."}, {"start": 391.416, "end": 392.416, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 392.416, "end": 393.241, "text": "Never mind."}, {"start": 393.241, "end": 395.416, "text": "There's no time for that now."}, {"start": 398.921, "end": 401.921, "text": "Pierce, it's starting to seem from observing the others"}, {"start": 401.921, "end": 404.921, "text": "that you're using the social leverage afforded you by your alleged deathbed"}, {"start": 404.921, "end": 408.921, "text": "to exact complicated acts of psychological vengeance on those closest to you."}, {"start": 408.921, "end": 409.576737704918, "text": "Vengeance?"}, {"start": 409.576737704918, "end": 409.7734590163934, "text": "No."}, {"start": 409.7734590163934, "end": 412.921, "text": "I always never wanted to hold a grudge, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 412.921, "end": 414.32916326530614, "text": "My father held grudges."}, {"start": 414.32916326530614, "end": 415.921, "text": "Always hated him for that."}, {"start": 415.921, "end": 417.921, "text": "Did you get along with your father?"}, {"start": 417.921, "end": 418.921, "text": "I got along with Adam."}, {"start": 418.921, "end": 420.921, "text": "Oh, that's no good, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 420.921, "end": 423.921, "text": "You don't want your dad to die before you tell him how you feel."}, {"start": 423.921, "end": 424.73581481481483, "text": "I'm sure you're right."}, {"start": 424.73581481481483, "end": 425.921, "text": "Look, let's nip this in the bud."}, {"start": 425.921, "end": 429.921, "text": "Pierce, we're sorry we didn't respond quickly enough to your pill addiction."}, {"start": 429.921, "end": 433.921, "text": "Is there any chance that apology is enough?"}, {"start": 433.921, "end": 436.921, "text": "Are you ready to be bequeathed upon, Jeff?"}, {"start": 436.921, "end": 437.7543333333333, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 437.7543333333333, "end": 439.921, "text": "Blow my mind."}, {"start": 439.921, "end": 441.921, "text": "I found your father."}, {"start": 441.921, "end": 443.921, "text": "Did you know?"}, {"start": 443.921, "end": 446.921, "text": "William Winger, born Oklahoma City in 1945."}, {"start": 446.921, "end": 451.921, "text": "1974, married Doreen Fitzgerald, divorced in 1983."}, {"start": 451.921, "end": 455.921, "text": "Most recently residing in Dorchester, currently sitting in a town car"}, {"start": 455.921, "end": 458.921, "text": "on its way to this very hospital."}, {"start": 458.921, "end": 461.883962962963, "text": "Should be here in an hour or so."}, {"start": 461.883962962963, "end": 463.921, "text": "Give or take a father."}, {"start": 463.921, "end": 464.921, "text": "That it?"}, {"start": 464.921, "end": 465.921, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 465.921, "end": 466.8300909090909, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 466.8300909090909, "end": 468.921, "text": "See you at the funeral."}, {"start": 470.921, "end": 472.921, "text": "And so it is bequeathed."}, {"start": 481.692, "end": 483.692, "text": "What are you going to say to your dad?"}, {"start": 483.692, "end": 485.692, "text": "I'm not going to say anything because I won't have to"}, {"start": 485.692, "end": 487.692, "text": "if Pierce is playing head games with us."}, {"start": 487.692, "end": 489.692, "text": "I've decided not to listen to it."}, {"start": 489.692, "end": 490.692, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 490.692, "end": 495.692, "text": "I'm not going to listen to the CD of you guys talking about me."}, {"start": 495.692, "end": 497.692, "text": "Because I forgive you."}, {"start": 497.692, "end": 499.692, "text": "But how do we know what we're being forgiven for?"}, {"start": 499.692, "end": 501.692, "text": "We don't even know what's on there."}, {"start": 501.692, "end": 503.692, "text": "And you never have to."}, {"start": 503.692, "end": 505.692, "text": "Hmm?"}, {"start": 507.692, "end": 509.23611764705885, "text": "Well, what if he is coming, though?"}, {"start": 509.23611764705885, "end": 510.692, "text": "What are you going to say to him?"}, {"start": 510.692, "end": 512.492, "text": "Here, I'll be him."}, {"start": 512.492, "end": 513.692, "text": "I'll be him."}, {"start": 513.692, "end": 514.172, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 514.172, "end": 514.532, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 514.532, "end": 516.332, "text": "I'm Jeff's dad."}, {"start": 516.332, "end": 516.692, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 516.692, "end": 517.6295, "text": "Hi, Jeff's dad."}, {"start": 517.6295, "end": 518.692, "text": "I'm Britta's dad."}, {"start": 518.692, "end": 519.2475555555556, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 519.2475555555556, "end": 519.692, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 519.692, "end": 520.2829090909091, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 520.2829090909091, "end": 520.7374545454546, "text": "Got drunk."}, {"start": 520.7374545454546, "end": 521.692, "text": "Didn't have a condom."}, {"start": 521.692, "end": 523.692, "text": "And her mom gets freaky when she hears all I'm going on."}, {"start": 523.692, "end": 524.2253333333333, "text": "Oh, God."}, {"start": 524.2253333333333, "end": 525.692, "text": "I wish I could relate."}, {"start": 525.692, "end": 527.692, "text": "But much like my son, I'm a closet homosexual."}, {"start": 527.692, "end": 528.692, "text": "Don't apologize for that."}, {"start": 528.692, "end": 530.692, "text": "You're talking to the guy that banged Britta's mom."}, {"start": 530.692, "end": 531.692, "text": "I have no standards."}, {"start": 531.692, "end": 532.8498947368421, "text": "Well, what do you say?"}, {"start": 532.8498947368421, "end": 533.7446315789474, "text": "We take a tumble."}, {"start": 533.7446315789474, "end": 534.692, "text": "I'll put on a wig."}, {"start": 534.692, "end": 535.0766153846154, "text": "That's it."}, {"start": 535.0766153846154, "end": 535.8458461538461, "text": "You're under arrest."}, {"start": 535.8458461538461, "end": 536.692, "text": "I'm an undercover cop."}, {"start": 536.692, "end": 537.692, "text": "It's not illegal to be gay."}, {"start": 537.692, "end": 538.692, "text": "It is here in Iran."}, {"start": 538.692, "end": 540.692, "text": "Now when we're in the green zone..."}, {"start": 540.692, "end": 541.692, "text": "That's Iraq, stupid."}, {"start": 541.692, "end": 542.692, "text": "What do I know?"}, {"start": 542.692, "end": 544.692, "text": "I'm Jeff Weir's dumb, gay dad."}, {"start": 546.692, "end": 549.692, "text": "My father was a two-bit con man of so little substance"}, {"start": 549.692, "end": 552.692, "text": "he couldn't leave a trail if he wanted to."}, {"start": 552.692, "end": 554.692, "text": "And I don't care if Pierce hired Scotland Yard."}, {"start": 554.692, "end": 556.692, "text": "He isn't going to track him down from a hospital bed."}, {"start": 556.692, "end": 559.692, "text": "I mean, money can't just make people appear."}, {"start": 559.692, "end": 560.7446315789474, "text": "Excuse me."}, {"start": 560.7446315789474, "end": 563.692, "text": "I'm looking for Troy Barnes."}, {"start": 563.692, "end": 565.692, "text": "Pierce Hawthorne sent me?"}, {"start": 565.692, "end": 565.8196595744681, "text": "Dr."}, {"start": 565.8196595744681, "end": 567.692, "text": "Charles, two, three, four, two, three, four."}, {"start": 569.692, "end": 571.692, "text": "Hey, Troy."}, {"start": 574.606, "end": 574.906, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 574.906, "end": 576.606, "text": "I'm LaVar Burton."}, {"start": 576.606, "end": 579.606, "text": "You just got LaVar Burton to come here for Troy?"}, {"start": 582.7099999999999, "end": 584.7099999999999, "text": "Is there anyone he can't produce?"}, {"start": 584.7099999999999, "end": 586.7099999999999, "text": "No, I'm really getting mad."}, {"start": 586.7099999999999, "end": 589.7099999999999, "text": "Why am I the only one who decided to torture her?"}, {"start": 596.7099999999999, "end": 598.7099999999999, "text": "I told Pierce a thousand times!"}, {"start": 598.7099999999999, "end": 601.7099999999999, "text": "I never wanted to meet LaVar in person!"}, {"start": 601.7099999999999, "end": 603.7099999999999, "text": "I just wanted a picture!"}, {"start": 603.7099999999999, "end": 606.7099999999999, "text": "You can't disappoint a picture!"}, {"start": 606.7099999999999, "end": 608.7099999999999, "text": "I hate you, Pierce!"}, {"start": 610.7099999999999, "end": 612.7099999999999, "text": "I hate you so much!"}, {"start": 617.7099999999999, "end": 618.31, "text": "Annie?"}, {"start": 618.31, "end": 619.7099999999999, "text": "I forgive you."}, {"start": 619.7099999999999, "end": 621.0099999999999, "text": "Annie Edison?"}, {"start": 621.0099999999999, "end": 623.7099999999999, "text": "Your bequeathel is at hand."}, {"start": 625.7099999999999, "end": 627.7099999999999, "text": "Do you have a regular job here?"}, {"start": 631.084, "end": 634.324, "text": "- Annie, I know you're being strong for me."}, {"start": 634.324, "end": 635.8639999999999, "text": "I give you permission to weep."}, {"start": 636.804, "end": 639.044, "text": "- I'm crying on the inside."}, {"start": 639.044, "end": 639.8839999999999, "text": "- Gross."}, {"start": 639.8839999999999, "end": 642.564, "text": "Well, in any case, I wanna give you this."}, {"start": 642.564, "end": 646.3639999999999, "text": "It's been in my family for six generations."}, {"start": 646.3639999999999, "end": 647.204, "text": "Not yours."}, {"start": 648.8639999999999, "end": 649.8639999999999, "text": "- Thank you."}, {"start": 655.92, "end": 658.6199999999999, "text": "- Wheelchair assist is emitting."}, {"start": 658.6199999999999, "end": 661.5199999999999, "text": "Can I please have a wheelchair assist in admitting please?"}, {"start": 661.5199999999999, "end": 664.3599999999999, "text": "- Bye."}, {"start": 664.3599999999999, "end": 666.5999999999999, "text": "(whimpers)"}, {"start": 667.7599999999999, "end": 669.8399999999999, "text": "- Jeff, do you wanna see your dad?"}, {"start": 669.8399999999999, "end": 671.1999999999999, "text": "- He's not coming."}, {"start": 671.1999999999999, "end": 672.04, "text": "- But do you wanna see him?"}, {"start": 672.04, "end": 673.3199999999999, "text": "- No."}, {"start": 673.3199999999999, "end": 675.5199999999999, "text": "- Then why aren't you leaving?"}, {"start": 675.5199999999999, "end": 677.56, "text": "- Because I don't care and I'm not gonna let him"}, {"start": 677.56, "end": 678.9999999999999, "text": "think that I care."}, {"start": 678.9999999999999, "end": 680.0799999999999, "text": "- Your dad or Pierce?"}, {"start": 680.0799999999999, "end": 681.2799999999999, "text": "- There is no dad."}, {"start": 681.2799999999999, "end": 683.2799999999999, "text": "Get this thing out of my face."}, {"start": 683.2799999999999, "end": 684.5199999999999, "text": "And don't you dare intercut this"}, {"start": 684.5199999999999, "end": 686.0799999999999, "text": "with footage of me freaking out."}, {"start": 690.7599999999999, "end": 692.0799999999999, "text": "- Ah!"}, {"start": 692.0799999999999, "end": 694.1199999999999, "text": "- Is there footage of you freaking out?"}, {"start": 694.1199999999999, "end": 697.8399999999999, "text": "- I bet I'm gonna kill you and Pierce and Britta"}, {"start": 697.8399999999999, "end": 701.2399999999999, "text": "and anyone else who thinks I care about any of this."}, {"start": 701.2399999999999, "end": 703.3199999999999, "text": "- So, do you go to school nearby?"}, {"start": 705.7199999999999, "end": 708.1199999999999, "text": "Well, are you more familiar with me"}, {"start": 708.1199999999999, "end": 710.5799999999999, "text": "from Star Trek or Reading Rainbow?"}, {"start": 710.5799999999999, "end": 711.9199999999998, "text": "Reading Rainbow was the show I hosted"}, {"start": 711.9199999999998, "end": 714.4399999999999, "text": "and produced for 25 years on PBS."}, {"start": 714.4399999999999, "end": 715.28, "text": "Never seen it."}, {"start": 716.7199999999999, "end": 719.68, "text": "♪ Butterfly in the sky ♪"}, {"start": 719.68, "end": 722.5999999999999, "text": "♪ I can go twice as high ♪"}, {"start": 722.5999999999999, "end": 723.9199999999998, "text": "♪ Take a look ♪"}, {"start": 723.9199999999998, "end": 725.3599999999999, "text": "♪ It's in a book ♪"}, {"start": 725.3599999999999, "end": 728.7599999999999, "text": "♪ Reading Rainbow ♪"}, {"start": 728.7599999999999, "end": 730.2599999999999, "text": "- Reading Rainbow?"}, {"start": 734.0999999999999, "end": 736.5999999999999, "text": "Who set phasers to love me?"}, {"start": 737.5999999999999, "end": 738.8799999999999, "text": "- What does it mean?"}, {"start": 738.8799999999999, "end": 739.9999999999999, "text": "- What do you mean, what does it mean?"}, {"start": 739.9999999999999, "end": 741.1199999999999, "text": "- No riddles."}, {"start": 741.1199999999999, "end": 742.8, "text": "You're screwing around with everyone."}, {"start": 742.8, "end": 744.1599999999999, "text": "You gave me a tiara."}, {"start": 744.1599999999999, "end": 744.9999999999999, "text": "What does it mean?"}, {"start": 744.9999999999999, "end": 748.7599999999999, "text": "Are these blood diamonds?"}, {"start": 748.7599999999999, "end": 751.1599999999999, "text": "- Are they Holocaust diamonds?"}, {"start": 751.1599999999999, "end": 751.9999999999999, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 751.9999999999999, "end": 754.2199999999999, "text": "- Well, what does it mean?"}, {"start": 754.2199999999999, "end": 757.0799999999999, "text": "- It means you're my favorite."}, {"start": 757.0799999999999, "end": 758.9999999999999, "text": "- What does that mean?"}, {"start": 758.9999999999999, "end": 759.9999999999999, "text": "I did it."}, {"start": 759.9999999999999, "end": 761.18, "text": "I gave away the money."}, {"start": 762.7599999999999, "end": 764.6399999999999, "text": "The Red Cross."}, {"start": 764.6399999999999, "end": 766.2399999999999, "text": "You know what that makes me?"}, {"start": 766.2399999999999, "end": 767.5999999999999, "text": "A terrible person."}, {"start": 767.5999999999999, "end": 769.4199999999998, "text": "Because if that camera wasn't on me,"}, {"start": 769.4199999999998, "end": 771.5999999999999, "text": "I would've taken that money right out of the mouths"}, {"start": 771.5999999999999, "end": 775.54, "text": "of crippled, starving, malaria-ridden, refugee kids,"}, {"start": 775.54, "end": 778.3599999999999, "text": "and now I know that forever."}, {"start": 778.3599999999999, "end": 779.54, "text": "- Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 781.3199999999999, "end": 784.68, "text": "- Louisa, you've got to forgive yourself."}, {"start": 784.68, "end": 785.5199999999999, "text": "- Look at me."}, {"start": 785.5199999999999, "end": 786.3599999999999, "text": "I've been giving all of you"}, {"start": 786.3599999999999, "end": 787.5199999999999, "text": "for the horrible things you've said to me."}, {"start": 787.5199999999999, "end": 789.1999999999999, "text": "- Oh, for crying out loud, Shirley."}, {"start": 789.1999999999999, "end": 790.3599999999999, "text": "We're gonna listen to it."}, {"start": 790.3599999999999, "end": 792.7599999999999, "text": "- I don't wanna listen to it, Louisa, please."}, {"start": 792.7599999999999, "end": 794.7599999999999, "text": "Louisa, Louisa, wait."}, {"start": 794.7599999999999, "end": 795.5999999999999, "text": "Louisa."}, {"start": 799.4399999999999, "end": 800.4799999999999, "text": "- I'll be right back."}, {"start": 800.4799999999999, "end": 803.1599999999999, "text": "Don't learn anything without me."}, {"start": 803.1599999999999, "end": 805.8799999999999, "text": "- So, how much do we all hate Shirley?"}, {"start": 805.8799999999999, "end": 807.1199999999999, "text": "- Paris, knock it off."}, {"start": 807.1199999999999, "end": 808.2399999999999, "text": "- Hey, James Bond."}, {"start": 808.2399999999999, "end": 811.3599999999999, "text": "Stop trying to record us with that stupid spy pen."}, {"start": 811.3599999999999, "end": 812.9999999999999, "text": "- We can see the blinking light."}, {"start": 812.9999999999999, "end": 814.3199999999999, "text": "- Why do you keep trying to record us"}, {"start": 814.3199999999999, "end": 815.4799999999999, "text": "bad-mouthing each other?"}, {"start": 815.4799999999999, "end": 817.4799999999999, "text": "- Because he thinks friendship is a competition"}, {"start": 817.4799999999999, "end": 819.1599999999999, "text": "and he's always trying to get the upper hand."}, {"start": 819.1599999999999, "end": 820.8799999999999, "text": "- Think Shirley's any different?"}, {"start": 820.8799999999999, "end": 821.7199999999999, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 822.56, "end": 824.04, "text": "- Hello."}, {"start": 824.04, "end": 825.8599999999999, "text": "- Guess we do owe you an apology, Shirley."}, {"start": 825.8599999999999, "end": 828.1599999999999, "text": "We shouldn't have said those things about you."}, {"start": 834.28, "end": 836.7599999999999, "text": "- I guess the lesson here is that I sometimes"}, {"start": 836.7599999999999, "end": 839.2599999999999, "text": "use a guild as a weapon."}, {"start": 839.2599999999999, "end": 840.3799999999999, "text": "- What are you doing?"}, {"start": 840.3799999999999, "end": 842.7599999999999, "text": "- Oh, just shooting a talking head?"}, {"start": 842.7599999999999, "end": 845.28, "text": "Or did you want me to be the only one"}, {"start": 845.28, "end": 846.3199999999999, "text": "who didn't have one?"}, {"start": 847.68, "end": 848.5199999999999, "text": "- No, go ahead."}, {"start": 850.7199999999999, "end": 852.7199999999999, "text": "- I think it stems from when I was..."}, {"start": 856.9199999999998, "end": 858.6399999999999, "text": "- So you found my father?"}, {"start": 858.6399999999999, "end": 860.6399999999999, "text": "- Yes, he's on his way."}, {"start": 860.6399999999999, "end": 862.7599999999999, "text": "I mean, if this is too much to handle,"}, {"start": 862.7599999999999, "end": 865.1199999999999, "text": "I completely understand and I can call it off."}, {"start": 865.1199999999999, "end": 866.7199999999999, "text": "- Actually, I think I'm ready to see him."}, {"start": 866.7199999999999, "end": 868.04, "text": "- Good."}, {"start": 868.04, "end": 868.8799999999999, "text": "Good for you."}, {"start": 871.8, "end": 874.2399999999999, "text": "- Oh, I should probably tell you."}, {"start": 874.2399999999999, "end": 876.9399999999999, "text": "If you're lying to me, if my father isn't coming,"}, {"start": 876.9399999999999, "end": 879.3999999999999, "text": "if a car pulls up and anyone other than my father"}, {"start": 879.3999999999999, "end": 882.06, "text": "steps out, say an actor or you in a wig,"}, {"start": 882.06, "end": 883.7199999999999, "text": "if you try to pull any Ferris Bueller,"}, {"start": 883.7199999999999, "end": 886.1599999999999, "text": "parent trap threes company, FX, FX2,"}, {"start": 886.1599999999999, "end": 888.6199999999999, "text": "the deadly art of illusion, bull (beep)"}, {"start": 888.6199999999999, "end": 891.0799999999999, "text": "I will beat you and there will be nothing"}, {"start": 891.0799999999999, "end": 892.52, "text": "mad, cap or wacky about it."}, {"start": 893.8999999999999, "end": 895.0799999999999, "text": "Understood."}, {"start": 895.0799999999999, "end": 895.9199999999998, "text": "- Crystal."}, {"start": 896.7199999999999, "end": 898.9799999999999, "text": "(knocking)"}, {"start": 910.04, "end": 912.0799999999999, "text": "- Hi, I'm Lavar."}, {"start": 912.0799999999999, "end": 913.0799999999999, "text": "- Oh, I know."}, {"start": 913.0799999999999, "end": 914.6399999999999, "text": "I was a huge fan of Reebop."}, {"start": 914.6399999999999, "end": 916.0799999999999, "text": "It was canceled before I was born,"}, {"start": 916.0799999999999, "end": 918.1599999999999, "text": "but I scored some VHS copies."}, {"start": 919.0799999999999, "end": 921.56, "text": "I was nostalgic from a very early age."}, {"start": 921.56, "end": 922.3999999999999, "text": "- Cool."}, {"start": 923.2399999999999, "end": 925.7199999999999, "text": "Hey, you know, I assumed that Troy was a fan,"}, {"start": 925.7199999999999, "end": 927.6999999999999, "text": "but he hasn't said a word to me since I got here"}, {"start": 927.6999999999999, "end": 929.7199999999999, "text": "and now I've gotta catch this flight."}, {"start": 929.7199999999999, "end": 931.1999999999999, "text": "- No, no, you can't go."}, {"start": 931.1999999999999, "end": 932.04, "text": "He loves you."}, {"start": 932.04, "end": 934.28, "text": "He talks about you all the time."}, {"start": 934.28, "end": 936.4599999999999, "text": "How much would it cost to change your flight 'til tomorrow?"}, {"start": 936.4599999999999, "end": 940.8799999999999, "text": "Is $261 enough 'cause that's all I've got?"}, {"start": 940.8799999999999, "end": 942.28, "text": "- That's all you've got?"}, {"start": 942.28, "end": 943.4599999999999, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 943.4599999999999, "end": 945.9999999999999, "text": "- No, you, you keep your money."}, {"start": 945.9999999999999, "end": 948.8, "text": "I'll, I'll reschedule."}, {"start": 948.8, "end": 949.6799999999998, "text": "- Oh my God, thank you."}, {"start": 949.6799999999998, "end": 951.52, "text": "He's gonna be so happy."}, {"start": 951.52, "end": 954.4999999999999, "text": "- You know, you are a very generous friend,"}, {"start": 954.4999999999999, "end": 956.28, "text": "but you're really stupid with your money."}, {"start": 956.28, "end": 957.6399999999999, "text": "- It's not that I'm selfish."}, {"start": 961.125, "end": 963.885, "text": "It's just that I'm really stupid with my money,"}, {"start": 963.885, "end": 966.1049999999999, "text": "which is why I'll never have a lot of it."}, {"start": 966.1049999999999, "end": 968.7649999999999, "text": "And because I'm a really generous friend."}, {"start": 968.7649999999999, "end": 969.925, "text": "Problem solved."}, {"start": 969.925, "end": 971.4449999999999, "text": "Dilemma deleted."}, {"start": 971.4449999999999, "end": 972.685, "text": "Put up for the win."}, {"start": 975.0849999999999, "end": 977.1049999999999, "text": "Oh, thank God he didn't take it."}, {"start": 977.1049999999999, "end": 980.125, "text": "Could you imagine bouncing a check to Kunta Kinte?"}, {"start": 987.9849999999999, "end": 990.645, "text": "(phone ringing)"}, {"start": 1005.645, "end": 1006.9649999999999, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 1006.9649999999999, "end": 1009.165, "text": "- Jeffrey, this is your father."}, {"start": 1010.5249999999999, "end": 1011.5849999999999, "text": "- Uh-huh."}, {"start": 1011.5849999999999, "end": 1013.2249999999999, "text": "- It's me, here in the sedan."}, {"start": 1014.2849999999999, "end": 1015.7849999999999, "text": "See, I'm waving."}, {"start": 1016.9649999999999, "end": 1019.8449999999999, "text": "I'm sorry I can't come any closer, my boy."}, {"start": 1019.8449999999999, "end": 1021.7649999999999, "text": "This is too difficult."}, {"start": 1021.7649999999999, "end": 1024.3649999999998, "text": "You look too much like your mother."}, {"start": 1024.3649999999998, "end": 1027.405, "text": "No, no, don't come closer as you were."}, {"start": 1027.405, "end": 1029.3249999999998, "text": "Well, I have to catch a flight to Kathmandu,"}, {"start": 1029.3249999999998, "end": 1030.205, "text": "but I just wanted to say,"}, {"start": 1030.205, "end": 1032.205, "text": "cherish the new friends that you made."}, {"start": 1033.3649999999998, "end": 1034.965, "text": "- They're your true family now."}, {"start": 1036.2849999999999, "end": 1038.605, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1038.605, "end": 1040.7649999999999, "text": "(yelling)"}, {"start": 1047.5249999999999, "end": 1049.8049999999998, "text": "- When you improvise a plan,"}, {"start": 1049.8049999999998, "end": 1051.2849999999999, "text": "sometimes you hit a speed bump,"}, {"start": 1051.2849999999999, "end": 1054.445, "text": "and sometimes you hit it so hard"}, {"start": 1054.445, "end": 1056.725, "text": "that you soar through the air,"}, {"start": 1056.725, "end": 1059.7649999999999, "text": "far beyond your initial expectations."}, {"start": 1059.7649999999999, "end": 1062.245, "text": "I set out to take revenge on Jeff Winger"}, {"start": 1062.245, "end": 1064.8049999999998, "text": "to scare him with the dose of his father."}, {"start": 1064.8049999999998, "end": 1068.645, "text": "Instead, I took over the role of his father."}, {"start": 1068.645, "end": 1070.085, "text": "Help make him a better man."}, {"start": 1071.0049999999999, "end": 1073.5249999999999, "text": "It'll be a long time before Jeff Winger"}, {"start": 1073.5249999999999, "end": 1075.405, "text": "underestimates me again."}, {"start": 1075.405, "end": 1077.725, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 1078.725, "end": 1081.165, "text": "- Why would you do something like this?"}, {"start": 1081.165, "end": 1083.485, "text": "Come on, Jeff, what?"}, {"start": 1083.485, "end": 1088.485, "text": "Because I'm sick of you people not taking me seriously."}, {"start": 1088.885, "end": 1090.725, "text": "You forget my birthday."}, {"start": 1090.725, "end": 1093.645, "text": "You don't invite me to your Dungeons and Dragons games"}, {"start": 1093.645, "end": 1096.645, "text": "or your secret trampoline."}, {"start": 1096.645, "end": 1098.965, "text": "You're gonna think I'm some kind of a joke."}, {"start": 1098.965, "end": 1101.0449999999998, "text": "This isn't disproving the theory."}, {"start": 1103.605, "end": 1104.605, "text": "Good point."}, {"start": 1104.605, "end": 1105.445, "text": "What'd you say?"}, {"start": 1105.445, "end": 1107.445, "text": "(yelling)"}, {"start": 1107.445, "end": 1111.125, "text": "- Apparently, I need to say some things to my father."}, {"start": 1111.125, "end": 1114.8049999999998, "text": "Things that I may have screamed at Pierce instead."}, {"start": 1115.965, "end": 1117.7649999999999, "text": "I'm not saying he doesn't deserve it."}, {"start": 1119.0449999999998, "end": 1120.485, "text": "But my father deserves it too."}, {"start": 1122.7649999999999, "end": 1127.0449999999998, "text": "- Pierce, I figured out your test."}, {"start": 1127.0449999999998, "end": 1131.8449999999998, "text": "Crowns, presents, punishments, favorites."}, {"start": 1131.8449999999998, "end": 1134.725, "text": "You're trying to show me the dangers of my own elitism."}, {"start": 1134.725, "end": 1137.645, "text": "My constant striving to be the best."}, {"start": 1137.645, "end": 1140.8449999999998, "text": "So I'm requeting this tiara."}, {"start": 1142.085, "end": 1143.5249999999999, "text": "Because if I become the kind of person"}, {"start": 1143.5249999999999, "end": 1145.645, "text": "who thinks it's their place to pick favorites"}, {"start": 1145.645, "end": 1150.2849999999999, "text": "and torture the rest, I'll die sad and alone."}, {"start": 1150.2849999999999, "end": 1152.685, "text": "And that's what you were trying to teach me."}, {"start": 1154.0049999999999, "end": 1155.605, "text": "- Very good, Annie."}, {"start": 1155.605, "end": 1156.605, "text": "You pass."}, {"start": 1162.556, "end": 1165.036, "text": "She's actually just my favorite."}, {"start": 1165.036, "end": 1167.536, "text": "(light music)"}, {"start": 1169.2759999999998, "end": 1170.9560000000001, "text": "So I thought the documentary format"}, {"start": 1170.9560000000001, "end": 1172.396, "text": "would be like fish in a barrel."}, {"start": 1172.396, "end": 1175.156, "text": "But as is the case with a real barrel of fish,"}, {"start": 1175.156, "end": 1177.9560000000001, "text": "after a while it can become cramped, chaotic, and stinky."}, {"start": 1180.116, "end": 1181.676, "text": "Fortunately, if in the end your documentary"}, {"start": 1181.676, "end": 1184.116, "text": "is turning out just as messy as real life,"}, {"start": 1184.116, "end": 1185.996, "text": "you can always wrap it up with a series of random shots"}, {"start": 1185.996, "end": 1189.3159999999998, "text": "which when cut together under a generic voiceover,"}, {"start": 1189.3159999999998, "end": 1191.3159999999998, "text": "suggest a profound thematic connection."}, {"start": 1192.7959999999998, "end": 1194.356, "text": "I'm not knocking it."}, {"start": 1194.356, "end": 1195.196, "text": "It works."}, {"start": 1196.2359999999999, "end": 1197.076, "text": "Guys."}, {"start": 1204.516, "end": 1205.356, "text": "- Aww."}, {"start": 1208.996, "end": 1213.196, "text": "- Jeff and I became kind of like father and son today."}, {"start": 1214.356, "end": 1215.556, "text": "- No, we did not."}, {"start": 1219.716, "end": 1222.476, "text": "Troy, I am telling you, man, the salmon is really good."}, {"start": 1224.836, "end": 1226.196, "text": "(sighs)"}, {"start": 1226.196, "end": 1228.036, "text": "Would you mind passing me the pepper?"}, {"start": 1230.7959999999998, "end": 1235.7959999999998, "text": "♪ Butterfly in the sky ♪"}, {"start": 1239.27, "end": 1242.4699999999998, "text": "♪ I can go twice as high ♪"}, {"start": 1242.4699999999998, "end": 1244.5099999999998, "text": "♪ Take a look ♪"}, {"start": 1244.5099999999998, "end": 1246.75, "text": "♪ It's in the book ♪"}, {"start": 1246.75, "end": 1249.07, "text": "♪ The reading rainbow ♪"}, {"start": 1249.07, "end": 1251.23, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 1255.31, "end": 1258.07, "text": "- Well, more fish for Kunta."}, {"start": 1261.5099999999998, "end": 1264.27, "text": "(dramatic music)"}]}